    "The amount already paid is not editable — it only moves through a fee payment.": "Kiasi kilicholipwa tayari hakiwezi kuhaririwa — hubadilika tu kupitia malipo ya ada.",
    "The amount is for one item. A quantity multiplies it. The server adds the lines up and works out the total, the balance and the status.": "Kiasi kinaeleweka kwa bidhaa moja. Idadi kinakizidisha. Seva inaongeza safu zote na kukikokotoa jumla, salio na hali.",
    "The animal or the patient the vaccine was given to.": "Mnyama au mgonjwa aliyopewa chanjo.",
    "The balance and the share count are not editable — they move through transactions.": "Salio na idadi ya hisa hazikiwezi kuhaririwa — hubadilika kupitia miamizi.",
    "The balance is worked out by the server, so what is left can never drift from what was taken.": "Salio hukokotolewa na seva, kwa hivyo kilichobaki kinaweza kusambuka kutoka kilichotolewa.",
    "The balance is worked out on the server from the entries already in the register, so what it says is what the register holds.": "Salio hukokotolewa kwenye seva kutoka maingizo yaliyo kwenye rejesta, kwa hivyo inayosema ndiyo inayoyomo kwenye rejesta.",
    "The balance of every controlled drug is worked out from the entries beneath it. Nothing can be dispensed that the register does not hold.": "Salio ya kila dawa ya udhamini hukokotolewa kutoka maingizo yaliyo chini yake. Hakuna kinaweza kutolewa ambacho rejesta haina.",
    "The business keeps its data. It simply cannot record anything new until the subscription is restored.": "Biashara huweka data yake. Huweza tu kusimama kurekodi kitu chochote kipya hadi usajili urejeshwe.",
    "The business's active staff are put on a run when it is opened.": "Wafanyakazi hai wa biashara hupangwa kwenye kipindi pale kikipanguliwa.",
    "The campaigns, the animals and the patients they were given to, and the dates the next doses fall due.": "Kampeni, wanyama na wagonjwa waliopewa, na tarehe dozi zinazofuata zinazokaribia.",
    "The cash you are given to start with.": "Pesa unayopewa kuanzia.",
    "The check": "Ukaguzi",
    "The controlled-drug register and the vaccination campaigns.": "Rejesta ya dawa za udhamini na kampeni za chanjo.",
    "The cost is recorded when goods are received.": "Gharama hukokotolewa bidhaa inapokelewa.",
    "The costs of running the business appear here once they are recorded.": "Gharama za kuendesha biashara zinaonekana hapa baada ya kurekodiwa.",
    "The customer book as it stands": "Kitabu cha wateja kama kilivyo sasa",
    "The customer is entering their secret PIN on their phone. The money is confirmed once": "Mteja anaingiza PIN yake ya siri kwenye simu yake. Pesa hutathibitishwa baada ya",
    "The customer said no": "Mteja alisema hapana",
    "The device limit comes from your plan and is checked on the server.": "Kizingiti cha vifaa kinatoka kwenye mpango wako na hukaguliwa kwenye seva.",
    "The dispatch and delivery dates are stamped by the server.": "Tarehe za kusambaza na kuzalisha hukokolewa na seva.",
    "The expected figure is finalised by the server when you close, from the cash sales and the cash movements on this shift.": "Takribo inayotarajiwa hukamilishwa na seva unapofunga, kutoka uuzaji wa pesa na mendo ya pesa kwenye shifti hii.",
    "The file": "Faili",
    "The hardware at your counters, and what state it is in.": "Vifaa katika kaunta zako, na hali yake.",
    "The invoice number identifies the document — it cannot be recorded twice for the same supplier.": "Namba ya ankara hutambua hati hiyo — haiwezi kurekodiwa mara mbili kwa msambaji mmoja.",
    "The invoice stays on file and stops counting towards what is owed. An invoice that has money against it cannot be voided.": "Ankara hiyo hubaki kwenye rekodi na kusitafutiwa kwenye kile kilichodaiwa. Ankara yenye pesa haiwezi kufutwa.",
    "The key is shown once and never stored. Only its hash is kept.": "Ufunguo huo huonyeshwa mara moja na huhifadhiwi kamwe. Hash yake pekee ndiyo inayohifadhiwa.",
    "The key is the stable name a subscription refers to. It cannot be changed later.": "Ufunguo ndio jina la kudumu ambalo usajili unarejelea. Haiwezi kubadilishwa baadaye.",
