    "The money the business is owed, newest first.": "Pesa inayodaiwa biashara, mpya kwanza.",
    "The month being reconciled, written as YYYY-MM.": "Mwezi unaousanidi, uliandikwa kama YYYY-MM.",
    "The next due date is the one you give — SMARTBUZ does not know how long a vaccine lasts.": "Tarehe inayofuata inayotakiwa ndiyo unayoipa — SMARTBUZ haijui chanjo inadumu muda gani.",
    "The nights are counted and the total worked out by the server.": "Usiku hukuhesabiwa na jumla hukokotolewa na seva.",
    "The number the customer record is made with.": "Namba ambayo rekodi ya mteja hutengenezwa kwa.",
    "The offers this business has put in front of its customers — what is still being written, what is out, and what has been accepted and is ready to become a sale.": "Ofa ambazo biashara hii imeweka mbele ya wateja wake — zile bado zikiandikwa, zile zilizo zimeisha, na zile zilizokubaliwa na ziko tayari kuwa uuzaji.",
    "The oldest credit that is still unpaid.": "Mikopo ya zamani zaidi ambayo bado haijalipwa.",
    "The oldest entries are at the bottom of the list.": "Maingizo ya zamani zaidi yako chini ya orodha.",
    "The payment did not go through": "Malipo hayakuenda vizuri",
    "The payment record will be removed from the books. This cannot be undone.": "Rekodi ya malipo itaondolewa kwenye vitabu. Huwezi kutenduliwa.",
    "The people are the business's own staff; the commission on each of them is worked out from the sales they made.": "Watu hawa ni wafanyakazi wa biashara yenyewe; bonasi ya kila mmoja hukokotolewa kutoka uuzaji waliofanya.",
    "The people who might buy — where they came from, what they asked for, and what they are worth while the business works out whether to go after them.": "Watu wanaoweza kununua — walitoka wapi, walikuwa wanauliza nini, na thamani yao wakati biashara ikifanya uamuzi wa kuwafuata.",
