    "These are decided on the server. A feature that is not on your plan is refused even if it is called directly.": "Haya hutathminiwa kwenye seva. Kipengele kisichomo kwenye mpango wako hukataliwa hata kikichitwa moja kwa moja.",
    "These are worked out from the records every time this page is opened, so they stay here until they are actually dealt with.": "Haya hukokotolewa kutoka rekodi kila wakati ukurasa huu hupigwa, kwa hivyo hubaki hapa mpaka zishughulikiwe.",
