    "This adapter is switched on, but it is still pointed at the provider&apos;s sandbox. Nothing it does reaches a real account.": "Kihuso hiki kimewashwa, lakini bado kinaelekezwa kwenye sandbox ya mtoja. Hakuna kichofanyacho hifikisha akaunti halisi.",
    "This area is for the SMARTBUZ platform team": "Eneo hili ni la timu ya jukwaa ya SMARTBUZ",
